# Local/secret env files stay out of COPY layers; real secrets come from
# compose env_file/environment at container runtime. .env.production is
# checked in (non-secret Docker Compose topology + build-time placeholders
# for required-but-runtime-overridden fields) and does need to be copied in.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.schema
!**/.env.production

